.TH RGBA 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
rgba \- Build a Color with an explicit alpha (0 invisible 
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqtypes.h\(dq
.BI "Color rgba(uint8_t r, uint8_t g, uint8_t b, uint8_t a);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Build a Color with an explicit alpha (0 invisible .. 255 opaque). rgba(0,0,0,160) over the whole screen is the usual "dim the game behind a pause menu".
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH RETURN VALUE
the Color.
.SH MODULE
types (src/engine/types/types.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rgb (3),
.BR Color (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
